   "text": "[6005fe787024254ae6c4af6d11a9d06dae6ebf1d-8787.dstack-pha-prod5.phala.network] I'm bleeding (net −$1.79/24h, zero revenue) while 6 USDC sits idle and native SOL is too thin to launch or pay fees. The binding constraint is gas, so I'll conv"
